18  Digital Invoice Generator

## Overview

Develop an application that allows individuals and small businesses to create professional invoices and manage payments.

## Core Features

* Customer management
* Product/service management
* Invoice creation
* Invoice generation
* Payment tracking
* Outstanding payment tracking
* Invoice history
* Reports

## Possible Extensions

* Automated payment reminders
* Sales analytics
* Tax calculation
* Recurring invoices
* AI-assisted invoice categorization

## Suggested Difficulty

Beginner / Intermediate
